{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002","quote":"澄字季玄，起家秘書郎，轉丞，清正有器望，累遷秘書監、太常、中護軍。孝武帝深愛之，以為冠軍將軍、吳國內史。太元末，琅邪王出居外第，妙選師傅，徵拜尚書，領琅邪王師。安帝即位，遷尚書左僕射，典選、王師如故。時澄腳疾，固讓，特聽不朝，坐家視事。又領本州大中正。及桓玄執政，以疾奏免，卒於家。安帝反正，追贈金紫光祿大夫。長子籍，早卒。次子融，元熙中，為大司農。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0157","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"何澄傳末分記兩子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-nan023-heyucontext-cheng-child-融","subject_person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_BA","object_person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_B","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"次子融","nan023_heyu_reading":"cheng-child-融","lineage":"paternal","birth_order":{"parent_person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_B","scope":"sons_of_parent","ordinal":2,"position":"unspecified","source_term":"次子","interpretation_status":"source_attested"}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002","quote":"澄字季玄，起家秘書郎，轉丞，清正有器望，累遷秘書監、太常、中護軍。孝武帝深愛之，以為冠軍將軍、吳國內史。太元末，琅邪王出居外第，妙選師傅，徵拜尚書，領琅邪王師。安帝即位，遷尚書左僕射，典選、王師如故。時澄腳疾，固讓，特聽不朝，坐家視事。又領本州大中正。及桓玄執政，以疾奏免，卒於家。安帝反正，追贈金紫光祿大夫。長子籍，早卒。次子融，元熙中，為大司農。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0164","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"何澄傳末分記兩子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-nan023-heyucontext-yu-cheng","subject_person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_BA*A","object_person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_B","predicate":"great_grandfather","qualifiers":{"source_term":"晉尚書左僕射澄曾孫也","nan023_heyu_read